WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.920
Thou return unto the ground, for out of it was thou taken.

2
00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:08.720
For dust thou art, and unto dust shalt thou return."

3
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:11.920
God looks at a living man and calls him dust.

4
00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.560
Even while you're alive, you are dust.

5
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:21.400
Yet,

6
00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:25.440
God put his divine image

7
00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:27.620
in dust.

8
00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.680
And he calls upon us,

9
00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:36.680
though you are made of dust, reflect my image.

10
00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:42.520
In order for dust to reflect a divine image,

11
00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:44.080
dust needs help.

12
00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:47.320
What kind of help?

13
00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.120
Divine help.

14
00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:51.760
Let me say it again, differently.

15
00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:55.320
It is impossible for a human being,

16
00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:58.520
without help from above, to reflect the character of God.

17
00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:00.120
To reflect the character of God.
